<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>About</h2>
      <span class="section-num">§ 01</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-photo"></div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>Hi, I'm Haven Dao, a mechanical engineer currently attending Palomar College with a focus/minor in aerospace engineering. Welcome to my website.</p>
        <p>I like taking things from a sketch to something you can actually hold — whether that's a <strong>CAD assembly</strong>, a hand-wired mechanical keyboard, or a deck I framed and built in the backyard. My aerospace minor shapes a lot of how I approach mechanical problems: thinking in terms of loads, materials, tolerances, and how air and forces move through a structure.</p>
        <p>I'm comfortable running a project end to end — model it, build it, test it, and fix what breaks along the way.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="work" class="projects">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
