      <div class="project-body">
        <span class="project-code">BUILD-01 · 2024</span>
        <h3>Hand-wired mechanical keyboard</h3>
        <p class="desc">Designed and built a custom mechanical keyboard from the plate up — sourcing switches, hand-wiring the matrix, and flashing custom firmware for the layout.</p>
        <div class="project-stats">
          <div class="stat"><span class="num">65%</span><span class="label">Layout</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><span class="num">68</span><span class="label">Switches wired</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Hand-wired</span>
          <span class="tag">QMK/VIA</span>
          <span class="tag">Soldering</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-links">
          <a href="#">GitHub repo</a>
          <a href="#">Build log</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="project-sheet">
      <div class="project-media">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 260 200">
          <line x1="30" y1="70" x2="230" y2="70"/>
          <line x1="30" y1="85" x2="230" y2="85"/>
          <line x1="30" y1="100" x2="230" y2="100"/>
          <line x1="30" y1="115" x2="230" y2="115"/>
          <line class="accent" x1="55" y1="115" x2="55" y2="160"/>
          <line class="accent" x1="130" y1="115" x2="130" y2="160"/>
          <line class="accent" x1="205" y1="115" x2="205" y2="160"/>
          <line x1="35" y1="160" x2="225" y2="160"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <span class="project-code">BUILD-02 · 2024</span>
        <h3>Backyard deck design &amp; build</h3>
        <p class="desc">Planned and built a backyard deck from the ground up — laying out footings and framing, running basic load checks on the joists, then cutting and installing the decking.</p>
        <div class="project-stats">
          <div class="stat"><span class="num">140 ft²</span><span class="label">Deck area</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><span class="num">16&quot; O.C.</span><span class="label">Joist spacing</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Structural framing</span>
          <span class="tag">Load calcs</span>
          <span class="tag">Power tools</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-links">
          <a href="#">Project photos</a>
          <a href="#">Full write-up</a>
